  "html": "<div id=\"step-q134103\" class=\"step questionWidget\" style=\"display: block;\"><div class=\"questionWidget-header\"><div class=\"questionWidget-title\">Question 1</div><div class=\"questionWidget-helpButton\">?</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-134103\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-text\"><p>A group of students is interviewed. The scatter plot above shows the correspondence between the hours they spent playing video games daily the week before the literature exam and the grade they got on the exam. Which of the following best describes the correlation between the variables in the scatter plot?</p>\n</div><table class=\"questionWidget-choicesTable\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-134103-a\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\" style=\"background: rgb(64, 64, 64); color: white;\">a</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\"> strong positive linear correlation</td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-134103-b\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">b</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\"> weak negative linear correlation</td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-134103-c\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">c</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\"> weak positive linear correlation</td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-134103-d\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">d</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\"> strong negative linear correlation</td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-134103-e\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">e</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\"> no linear correlation</td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-submitButton disabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-spinnerFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-spinner\" style=\"display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-result\"><div class=\"questionWidget-incorrectIcon\"><img src=\"/img/incorrect-answer.svg\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-incorrectText\">Incorrect</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><div id=\"graphic-q-134103-e-0\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-134103-e-0\"></div>\n\n<p>We note the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>The points in the scatter plot seem to follow a straight line with a <em>negative</em> slope. So, we have a <em>negative</em> correlation.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>The points lie pretty close to the corresponding trend line. So, we have a <em>strong</em> correlation.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the variables have a <em>strong negative</em> linear correlation.</p>\n</div></div>",
